Q3IcHCGAoDQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["2025.12.16\n已光顧多次，老闆不定期增加新品，閒聊之下得知，老闆常常趁空檔去日本考察新的拉麵口味。\n因為對餐飲的執著，高湯是老闆店內自己熬煮，非食品廠濃縮加熱來著。今天吃了新品海陸牡蠣拉麵，不得不說濃郁口感加上檸檬提味畫龍點睛，一口接一口一下就完食。雖然可免費加麵，但是我已經很飽啦！\n店內燈光明亮，空氣流通是很舒適的用餐環境，學生依規定還能折抵20元。老闆也很熱情健談，尤其跟他聊到關於餐飲與釣魚，整個就是很尬聊（當然要在忙碌之餘的空檔）",null,[0,53]]]],[],[null,null,14883,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25obVNrdERTbEpvYW0xM1p6WkthWFpVZHpKSU5YYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7cae8f306130cc37!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnhmSktDSlJoam13ZzZKaXZUdzJINXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25obVNrdERTbEpvYW0xM1p6WkthWFpVZHpKSU5YYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25obVNrdERTbEpvYW0xM1p6WkthWFpVZHpKSU5YYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25obVNrdERTbEpvYW0xM1p6WkthWFpVZHpKSU5YYxILMGRGRDB0RURuN0waPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uaG1Ta3REU2xKb2FtMTNaelpLYVhaVWR6SklOWGMSCzBkRkQwdEVEbjdMIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARN8wwYTCPrnwqCzBkRkQwdEVEbjdM\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwii--aqtNeWAxX5ZvUHHealGzgQoykIYigO"],null,[null,[[1,2]]]],"0ahUKEwjw5eyqtNeWAxWtd14EHTaBN08Q0pMFCAIoAA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwii--aqtNeWAxX5ZvUHHealGzgQ0pMFCEkoAA"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KTU9VRk1aMjFwWkZkRmExbG1PR1ZPWWpCZldVRRAB",["0x0:0x7cae8f306130cc37",null,1783066173874490,1783066173874490,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107131253390958723149/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["now you see me","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLWKpg9b2c0TbvAKt0EwOK2lXsJsILGF721fJRxlsbnb1Rlmg\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107131253390958723149?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"107131253390958723149",null,893,2469,null,[1,8,1],36,["在地嚮導 · 893 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwii--aqtNeWAxX5ZvUHHealGzgQpr8GCGQoAA"]]]],null,"2 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48d